### Prueba de Login con Email
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "login": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "password"
}

###

### Prueba de Login con Usuario
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "login": "admin",
    "password": "password"
}

###

### Prueba de Registro
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "usuario": "testuser",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "password_confirmation": "password123"
}

###

### Obtener usuario actual (requiere token)
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Cerrar sesión (requiere token)
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Refrescar token (requiere token)
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

# ============================================
# ENDPOINTS DE ACTIVIDADES
# ============================================

### Listar todas las actividades
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/actividades
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Listar actividades de hoy
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/actividades/hoy
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Ver detalle de una actividad
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/actividades/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Crear nueva actividad
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/actividades
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "nombre_actividad": "Entrenamiento Matutino",
    "fecha_actividad": "2026-02-05",
    "descripcion": "Sesión de entrenamiento físico"
}

###

### Actualizar actividad
PUT http://localhost/control-politico/api/actividades/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "nombre_actividad": "Entrenamiento Vespertino",
    "fecha_actividad": "2026-02-05",
    "descripcion": "Sesión actualizada"
}

###

### Eliminar actividad
DELETE http://localhost/control-politico/api/actividades/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

# ============================================
# ENDPOINTS DE ASISTENCIA
# ============================================

### Registrar asistencia mediante código QR
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/qr
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "codigo": "c81e728d9d4c2f636f067f89cc14862c",
    "id_actividad_fk": 1,
    "observacion": "Registro por QR"
}

###

### Registrar entrada (marcado de asistencia)
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/entrada
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "id_actividad_fk": 1,
    "id_persona_fk": 1,
    "observacion": "Llegada puntual"
}

###

### Registrar salida
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/salida
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "id_asistencia": 1,
    "observacion": "Completó la sesión"
}

###

### Consultar mi registro de hoy
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/mi-registro-hoy?id_actividad_fk=1&id_persona_fk=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Historial de asistencias
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/historial?id_persona_fk=1&fecha_inicio=2026-02-01&fecha_fin=2026-02-28
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Ver asistencias de una actividad
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/actividad/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### Registrar permiso
POST http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/permiso
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
    "id_actividad_fk": 1,
    "id_persona_fk": 1,
    "observacion": "Motivo médico - certificado presentado"
}

###

### Obtener estadísticas
GET http://localhost/control-politico/api/asistencia/estadisticas?id_persona_fk=1&fecha_inicio=2026-02-01&fecha_fin=2026-02-28
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###
